<div id="p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="p2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_minipage ltx_align_center ltx_align_middle" style="width:447.2pt;"><span id="p2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:144%;">TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification 
<br class="ltx_break">for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering 
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:83%;">(Supplementary Materials)</span></span></p>
</div>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Additional Results</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide additional visualizations of manually annotated structural anomalies from diverse generative models and synthetic structural anomalies generated by our rendering engine in Fig. <a href="#A9.F12" title="Figure 12 ‣ Appendix I Limitations ‣ TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>, evaluation samples of TextPecker in Fig. <a href="#A9.F13" title="Figure 13 ‣ Appendix I Limitations ‣ TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>, and qualitative comparisons between Flux.1[dev] <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite> and its RL-optimized variants in Fig. <a href="#A1.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix A Additional Results ‣ TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A1.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2602.20903v1/RL_Flux_vis.png" id="A1.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:685/456;" width="685" height="456" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A1.F5.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>: </span><span id="A1.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative Comparisons of Text Rendering for Flux.1[dev] <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib33" title="" class="ltx_ref">28</a>]</cite> and RL-Optimized Variants.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
