<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A4.F8.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 8</span>: </span><span id="A4.F8.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Qualitative comparisons of text rendering results (<span id="A4.F8.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Chinese</span>) among different RL baseline settings.
RL-TextPecker denotes the RL setting in the main paper,
and RL-SQPA refers to our enhanced RL setting as described in Sec. <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D Additional Results on RL for VTR ‣ TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
