<div id="A5.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A5.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We provide detailed statistics of the structural perception test set in Tab. <a href="#A5.T12" title="Table 12 ‣ E.3 Structural Anomaly Perception Test Set ‣ Appendix E Details of Dataset ‣ TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">12</span></a>.
To further validate the fairness and effectiveness of our results, we additionally conduct evaluations on a <span id="A5.SS3.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">real-only</span> test split (all synthetic samples excluded), with results presented in Tab. <a href="#A5.T13" title="Table 13 ‣ E.3 Structural Anomaly Perception Test Set ‣ Appendix E Details of Dataset ‣ TextPecker: Rewarding Structural Anomaly Quantification for Enhancing Visual Text Rendering" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">13</span></a>.</p>
</div>
